{
 "description": "Released classical MD runs (LAMMPS, rigid-ion/EAM force fields, fixed volume) of three fluorite-structure ionic conductors, recorded for heat-transport analysis. Each run is 0.8 ns of production after equilibration at the target temperature; NVE runs are microcanonical, NVT runs keep a stochastic velocity-rescaling (CSVR) thermostat on during production. The input deck of every run is returned with its data.",
