  "series": "Six time series sampled every frame_interval_ps = 0.08 ps (10000 frames, 800 ps), in the order of series_columns: the three Cartesian components of the deck's compute myHeatFlux and of the summed anion velocities, in LAMMPS metal units, exactly as written to the thermo log except that the 8 fs thermo output has been band-limited to 6.25 THz (ideal low-pass) and resampled to 0.08 ps.",
  "encoding": "series[column] is base64 of little-endian int16 values; physical value = int16 * scale[column]. In Python: np.frombuffer(base64.b64decode(s), \"<i2\") * scale.",
